">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-08\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"location\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BVI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"decisions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"annual_budget_approval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outsourced_functions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bookkeeping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"provider\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local_agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"supervised_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"board\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priced_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arm's_length\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份结构的价值在于它把&quot;实质&quot;从形容词变成了可核对的清单：每一项都有一个文件支撑，每一场董事会都有日期、地点与决策事项。年度审查时逐项核对即可，见 <a href=\"../entity-structure-ops/entity-substance-review\">经济实质年度审查</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计与业务规模匹配\">设计与业务规模匹配</h2><p>实质要求的成本与集团的业务规模直接相关，架构设计应当在这种匹配关系上做出选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集团特征</th>\n<th>建议的实体层级</th>\n<th>实质投入重点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一市场、收入小</td>\n<td>一层运营实体，不做离岸控股</td>\n<td>当地经营实质（办公室、员工）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多市场、收入中等</td>\n<td>控股 + 运营两层</td>\n<td>控股层保持最轻实质，投入放在运营层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多市场、区域管理集中</td>\n<td>控股 + 区域总部 + 运营</td>\n<td>区域总部必须有真实决策与管理职能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型集团、跨门槛</td>\n<td>上述 + 结算实体</td>\n<td>全部层级都要有可出示的实质证据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>经济实质要求来自欧盟清单机制、BEPS 有害税收实践论坛与各注册地立法的三线合力，方向是&quot;低税率 + 实质要求&quot;取代&quot;零成本空壳&quot;。</li>\n<li>判定要素收敛为四问：当地有没有足够的人、足够的运营支出、关键决策与资产管理是否在当地发生。</li>\n<li>大多数测试不设统一数值门槛，取决于事实与整体合理性；纯控股实体的要求低于从事实际经营的实体。</li>\n<li>外包被允许，但要求有效监督、合理定价、不重复计算；共享服务中心是可行路径。</li>\n<li>董事会构成与受益所有人信息会通过信息交换与登记申报在辖区间流动，多层嵌套的隐匿效果在下降。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读（本 hub 内）</strong>：<a href=\"hk-sg-us-holding-operating\">控股/运营/结算实体区域布局</a> 讲区域选择；<a href=\"trading-entity-function-risk\">贸易主体功能与风险定位</a> 讲功能画像；<a href=\"../entity-structure-ops/entity-substance-review\">经济实质年度审查</a> 讲如何按年核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经济实质与实体设立要求","id":"经济实质与实体设立要求"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：实质要求的来源","id":"核心概念-实质要求的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"实质测试的通用判定要素","id":"实质测试的通用判定要素"},{"level":3,"text":"纯控股实体与混合实体的差别","id":"纯控股实体与混合实体的差别"},{"level":2,"text":"控股与离岸地的实质要求","id":"控股与离岸地的实质要求"},{"level":2,"text":"三条合规的降本路径","id":"三条合规的降本路径"},{"level":3,"text":"共享服务中心","id":"共享服务中心"},{"level":3,"text":"董事会安排的合理化","id":"董事会安排的合理化"},{"level":3,"text":"实质投入的按层分配","id":"实质投入的按层分配"},{"level":2,"text":"经济实质年度申报的结构","id":"经济实质年度申报的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"设计与业务规模匹配","id":"设计与业务规模匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"贸易主体功能与风险定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-entity-trade-structure/entity-footprint-design/trading-entity-function-risk"},"next":{"title":"合同/资金/发票/货物流对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-entity-trade-structure/four-flow-alignment/contract-fund-invoice-goods-flow"}}